      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu dakufuma kudi Yehova denjili kudi Yeremiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Nyamu kaku wukunkumuki kwitala dakaŋemi, nakakuti yishiluku mazu ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinu kukunku muka kwitala dakaŋemi, kumuwana wudi nakukoŋa mudimu windi hambuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chuma chewumba chadiŋi nakuwumbayi chichatamini mumakasa ayena kaŋemi, hakuchiwumba chuma chacheŋi mwomwatiyiliyi kagemi kuwaha kuwumba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova hidikwinza kudami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Enu akwamutaŋa waIsarela, ami nikaŋanyi kuyila mwaneliyi kagemi iwu? Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. Tiyenu, chekalaŋa iwumba muchikasa chakagemi, dichi chimudenu muchikasa chami, enu akwamutaŋa waIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hampinji yinakahosha jakubwita nikuhumuna nikujilumuna hela muza hela wanta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyi muzo wuwunateni wakabalumuka nakuleka yuma yawu yatama, ami nakabalumuka nakuleka vuma yatama yinatogojokeli kuwukoŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hampinji yinakatena jakutuŋa nikutumba muza hela wanta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyi wukwila yuma yatama kumesu ami nákubula kwovwahila izu dami, ami nakabalumuka nakuleka yuma yayiwahi yinateneni kuwukoŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu kahoshi nawaYuda, nawashakama muYerusalema, neyi, Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiyenu, nidi nakuyituŋala yatama, nidi nakuyikasa kasila chuma chakuyikasila. Funtenu munjila jenu jatama wejima wenu, wahishenu njila jenu niyuma yimwelaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena hiyakwila nawu, Hawuhandilu hosi, tukukumina dakwenda mwaya yuma yitunakasakasi, tukukumina dakwila mwaya kuchinchika kwanyichima yetu yatama wejima wetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova nahoshi nindi, Ihulenu mukachi kanyuza, nenu, Hinyi watiyahu dehi yuma yidi chochichi? Mujiki waIsarela, nakoŋi chuma chikweti niŋaŋanyi kumaji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nvula yachishika yitooka yakuLebanoni yikaŋanyi kwilola damumpata? Meji atuuta afumaŋa kwakulehi omi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ami ananvulameni dehi kwawu, anocheli chuma chakuhemesha insensi, anayiteda ŋeshi dehi munjila jawu, munjila jakunyaka, mwaka endaŋa munjila jamumbadi, munjila yakadi kudima muhaŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwaka abalumuni ituŋa dawu diikali dakuhayama antu, diikali dakuyi ŋilewaŋa nyaka yejima; antu ejima akahitaŋaku akahayamaŋa, akadile mbutaŋa nanyitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayi palagesha kumesu achilumbu neyi nampepela yakumusela; ifuku dakamonawu kukala nakatala nyima jawu, hinakatala mesu awuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwila nawu, Tuyenu twaka mukasa kasili Yeremiya yuma yakumukasila; muloŋa nshimbi hiyakanogela kudi kapristuku, hela mpùŋa kudi inukwama ana, hela izu kudi kaprofwetuku. Tuyenu tumwetenu nedimi, bayi tusha muchima kwizu dindi nidimuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, shaku muchima kudami, wutiyilili kwizu danawa adi nakuleta ntadi nanami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayayiwahi alubwiluhu yatama muloŋa wumi wami anawupundili dehi ikela. Anukaku chinemeni kumesu eyi nakuyihoshela yayiwahi, kulonda kutola kulendumuka kweyi kuyifumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi hanaku anyanawu munzala, yihani kuŊovu jampoku yakabali; aŋodi jawu ashali akadi anyana, ekali antuluwa; antu awu amayala ayijahi nachipupu; anyi kwenzi jawu ayitapi kunji tanampo kuya kabali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwakayi letela chendu chakuyi kasumwisha mumatalawu mwakatiyakani nyiteti, nanochu chana mpundiluwu ikela dakufwami, chatilawu dehi nyendu yami nyihetu yakusweka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu eyi Yehova, eyi weluka mpùŋa yawu yejima yanankwatiluwu yakunjaha. Bayi wuyanakena kuluwa kwawuku, bayi wujimapesha nshidi yawu kumesu eyuku, ayidimbwishi lukutu kumesu eyi; kayikoŋi hampinji yiwakazuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
